WEBVTT

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.130
Well then, I'll be seeing you.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.470
W... Wait a sec, Oniichan!

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.230
Yippee!

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:22.410
If I seem that way...

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.700
Darling, you're the worst!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.010
Wh... What in the world am I doing here...?

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:12.600
Dangerous Auto-Suggestion -
Kyosuke's Metamorphosis.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.440
Gee!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:38.550
Have you decided yet, Oniichan?! Milk? Or Coffee?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:44.100
Coffee sounds good...
but I might want to drink milk too...

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.350
Gosh! Do you have to agonize that much over it?!

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:50.960
Oniichan is wondering if orange juice
would be a better choice.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:56.200
Geez, Kazuya! Since when did you...

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.600
He read your mind!
Kazuya's always a step ahead of you!

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.650
What's with this?!
Eat your meals at your own place!

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.170
Never mind that, would you PLEASE make up your mind?!

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:10.370
If you want coffee,
I've got to warm it up again, y'know!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.540
You're such an indecisive imbecile!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.890
Er, no... I don't think that I am...

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:17.470
Of course you are! Right?

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.300
Yup! Yup!
Of course you are! Right?

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:18.390
Of course you are! Right?

00:03:18.390 --> 00:03:21.630
That's right. Men should be
more straightforward about things.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.830
Er, no... It's not like I'm
like this every day...

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.900
Y'know, he just spent at least five minutes

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.250
trying to decide which socks to wear!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.880
So silly!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:33.210
Yeek!
So silly!

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:33.300
So silly!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:34.840
Now that's embarrassing.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:39.570
Don't you know that more than anything, girls hate indecisive guys!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.640
The other day, he was late for school 'cause he couldn't decide...

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.750
...whether to ride on the bus or the train!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.380
He's always been like that,
since he was small.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.430
Yup. In Paper-Rock-Scissors,
he's always showing his hand late.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:55.500
I... I just remembered that I haven't washed up yet.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:09.700
Certainly, what everybody's saying about me is true.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:15.880
Needless to say, nobody is
more concerned about this than me!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.620
Th... This isn't good!
I've gotta do something about it!

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:48.720
I wish I were a lot more intensively decisive!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.780
Intensively decisive, eh...?

00:04:54.830 --> 00:05:07.760
Decisive... Decisive...

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:12.280
Oniichan! If you don't hurry up,
we'll be late for school!

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:15.680
Oh, gosh! He makes me so mad!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.720
Hello there. Thank you for waiting.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.520
Gosh! You're such a pain!
Hello there. Thank you for waiting.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:21.610
Hello there. Thank you for waiting.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.380
Forget him. Let's go!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.330
Wait a minute.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.360
Are you going to walk,
when you're going to be late for school?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.990
THIS is one of those moments
the Power ought to be used, isn't it?

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.840
B... But...

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:37.550
How could you not realize
such a trivial thing as that?!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:41.700
Say what?! You're the one who's always telling us not to use the Power!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.740
That was then; this is now.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:46.180
Oh... You're unfair!
That was then; this is now.

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.740
Oniichan!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.550
Well then, I'll be seeing you.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.990
W... Wait a sec, Oniichan!

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.890
Oniichan, you're not fair!

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:07.730
H... Hold on a sec, Kurumi!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.230
Good morning!

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:29.020
Asshole! What the hell do ya think you're doing, you fu...

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.300
Ow...

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.410
Hi, Hikaru. Good morning.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:38.760
D... Darling! Wh... What were you doing,
dropping in so suddenly?

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:43.360
I wanted to see you as soon as I could...
so I flew, you see.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.400
Y... You were thinking of me THAT much?!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.530
Darling!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.880
Yippee! Yeah!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.640
Darling, you're so wonderful today!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.830
Hikaru!

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.530
How could you...
start this early in the morning?!

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.360
You bastard! Kasuga!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.580
Yuusaku!

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:10.320
Now, now... Your jealousy is
most unbecoming, my friend.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.580
What the...?!

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:15.600
Wh...Why you... You think you're so hot!

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.280
Wh...Why you!

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:39.560
G...Goddammit!

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:46.650
Why's he fighting with himself?! What a weirdo!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.580
Let's go, Darling.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.430
H...Hikaru!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.840
Goddammit!

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.610
Wh...What...What happened?!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.550
Oniichan, you stud!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.850
What are they? Letters of condolence?

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:17.890
You oaf! These are love letters!
Love letters!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.000
Wow! All of them?!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.800
This one's for Kurumi, see...
Wow! All of them?!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:21.890
Wow! All of them?!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:27.200
...this one's for Manami, then there's one for Ikue in Homeroom "C!" Ha!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:31.440
Uh-huh, that's a good idea! A saturation bombardment!

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.140
Hi there! Good morning, my friends!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.540
What a refreshing morning it is!
Right, Komatsu-kun?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.420
"Komatsu-kun?"

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:46.330
Days like this make me want to shout at the blue sky with all my might!
"Komatsu-kun?"

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:46.410
"Komatsu-kun?"

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.820
Maybe the summer heat has finally penetrated and cooked his brain!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.610
Right!

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.870
Oh? What's this?

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.360
It doesn't matter what it is!
Oh? What's this?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.490
Hmm...?

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:01.800
A love letter?! This isn't good!

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:05.720
Writing love letters is what girls do!

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:10.010
If you're a man, then be straightforward! Deal with it head on!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.670
Isn't that what it means to be young?!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.690
Isn't that what our youthful days
are all about?!

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:24.510
Talk about corny! His brain DID
get cooked by the summer heat!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.500
Like butter.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:33.930
Got something in your eyes...?

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.950
All rise! Bow!

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:49.750
Kasuga! Wait! Don't do it!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.510
So you are Ikue?

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:01.130
The truth is that Komatsu from
my homeroom has a crush on you.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:05.860
What're ya doing...?!

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:09.070
That Kasuga... His heart must've bloated or something!

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.410
There you go!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.720
All right!
There you go!

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:13.780
There!
All right!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:14.320
There!

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.480
Hey!
There!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.770
Oh wow!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.670
"Chemistry Lab"

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.580
Hey, Kasuga! Are you crazy?!
Stop it! Stop!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:29.790
Ta-da!

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.450
Hey! Lady!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.400
"Sandwich Special ¥200"

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.140
Almost there!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.740
No, Kurumi!
Almost there!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.170
You're not supposed to do that!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:56.700
Cuz! Cuz! Just for once I wanted to eat a Legendary Cutlet Sandwich!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:12:00.040
And you think that's a good reason for you to use the Power?!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:02.940
Oniichan's using it lots!

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:03.890
Howdy!

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:04.690
Huh?
Howdy!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.690
Hikaru! Will you please listen to what I've got to say?!

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.010
What happened this morning was... well...

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.520
...junior high school students shouldn't be... doing...

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:25.080
Kurumi!

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:37.190
Y...You're rather entertaining, eh, Yuusaku!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.860
La la la la, Lunch! La la la la, Lunch!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.090
Darling, let's do lunch...

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.690
Say, Kasuga, won't you have my lunch?

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:49.040
I made these fried shrimp myself!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:52.010
You'll love my salad for sure!
I made these fried shrimp myself!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.490
This fried shrimp... It's pretty good!

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.390
Think so? I'm glad!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:13:00.590
Darling! Let's have lunch together like we always do!

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.710
What? I can't eat another bite.

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:08.380
Sorry, but I'd better take a rain check for today.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.920
Darling, you're the worst!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.130
Can you believe what Darling did?

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:37.230
He looked oh-so-happy, all surrounded by girls.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:44.110
They are so wrong! 'Cuz I'm the one who first discovered his charm!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.590
Don't you agree, Madoka?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.140
Huh?! Yeah...

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:53.580
If they think they can have him now,
they're too late!

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:57.360
More than anybody else in the world, I'm thinking of Darling dearly...

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:59.800
I love him the best!

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.900
You're right.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.060
But...

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:08.800
...the way it is now...
it feels as if Darling might leave me.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.830
Somehow, that's the kind of
feeling that I get.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.730
It'll be just fine, Hikaru.
He's... just trying to show off.

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:20.560
But!

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.700
He's just trying to look cool in front of you, that's all.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:25.670
I wonder...

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:31.370
Yup. If that wasn't so,
there's no way he could do such a thing.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:37.340
Oh! Maybe Darling is going through his "period of rebellion!"
"Period of rebellion:" a.k.a. terrible twos.

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:37.450
"Period of rebellion:" a.k.a. terrible twos.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.520
What?!

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.270
Madoka?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.290
C'mon, Madoka, what's so funny about that?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.000
Got a minute?

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:56.600
What is it, Ayukawa-kun?
Got a minute?

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.600
"-kun?!"

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:02.860
Kasuga! Wanna walk home together?

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:05.910
Let's go to a coffee shop along the way!

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:10.850
If you don't mind... I've got a bit of business to take care of here first.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:16.300
Oh?

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:20.250
So, what is it that you want to talk to me about?

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.130
It's okay to show off, but...

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.010
...you made Hikaru cry, y'know.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:29.370
I don't think it's a good idea to do things that are so unlike you.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.460
It's not like I'm going overboard.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.360
What's with this sudden change of attitude?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.810
Say, you're not working at ABCB today, right?

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:39.290
Huh? Uh-huh.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.080
How about it...
Wanna go to a disco tonight?

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:47.150
Don't put me on.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:59.160
Isn't this the first time... that I've asked you out?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:14.310
Fine. But, just what's gotten...

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.020
Well then, I'll meet you in front of Möbius at 7.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.400
Be sure to dress sharp!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.730
Thanks for waiting!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:54.870
You look great! Quite the little devil.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.920
Really? Thanks.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:01.790
Well? Shall we be off?

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.850
Is anything wrong?

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.800
No... Nothing.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:31.640
Tears shouldn't be held back, you know.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:33.390
It's not you to cry like a baby, you know.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.460
Yeah! Ushiko!

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:35.600
It's not you to cry like a baby, you know.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.700
Umao!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:36.830
It's not you to cry like a baby, you know.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:37.800
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:39.500
If you wanna vent your anger on someone...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.140
Wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.160
If you wanna vent your anger on someone...

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:50.320
...ride on the beat... and say good-bye.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:56.560
You're not the only one, Lonely Midnight Girl.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:18:02.220
We'll sing to blow away the sadness...

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.560
S... Sorry!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.700
It's not "Cheek Time" yet.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.830
I'm thirsty... from having danced so much.

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:28.330
What is it?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:32.340
I want to look at you like this forever.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:32.690
It'll make a difference if you make a noise on the floor...

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:33.960
What's with you today?!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.090
It'll make a difference if you make a noise on the floor...

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.760
What do you mean?

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.090
It'll make a difference if you make a noise on the floor...

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:38.620
You being so smooth.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:39.660
It's useless crying like a baby, you know.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:43.030
If I seem that way...

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:44.100
It's useless crying like a baby, you know.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:44.860
... it's because of you.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:50.240
If you wanna be treated like a baby by someone...

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.140
Er... I...

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:52.640
Before you act so special..."Knock On!"

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:57.130
E... Excuse me for a sec.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:57.220
Before you act so special..."Knock On!"

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.340
You're not the only one...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:14.160
"...it's because of you..."

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:21.930
Breakin' Heart... Kiss me, 'til the morning comes.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.660
Say, you 're kinda cute!

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:33.440
If I seem that way...
it's because of you. Oh! Gosh!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.270
Oh, if it isn't Miss Madoka.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.120
Please, why don't you be by my side also.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.930
That's an unusual handshake!

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.860
H... Hey! Like, what's the story here?!

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.670
Wh... What's going on?
Why did you bring me here?

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.050
A-ha! I bet you got jealous!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.690
You silly thing! It was just a joke!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.900
The one that's in my heart is...
you, and only you.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.930
You know that, don't you?

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:24.420
Enough is... enough!

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:35.620
Well? Did that cool your head a little?

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:39.240
You're gonna... even put out the passionate fire in me!

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:54.460
What's with you...?
You're usually so indecisive!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.130
You're crazy!

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.920
Indecisive?!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:15.830
Indecisive... Indecisive...

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.400
Indecisive...

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:20.470
Oh?!

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:24.100
What in the world... am I doing here?!

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:26.130
Huh?!

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:30.560
A...yukawa?!

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:41.120
While looking at myself in the mirror this morning, it seems that...

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:44.890
...I hypnotized myself.

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:47.950
You're such a simpleton, Oniichan!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.450
I suppose it's a new Power I've just discovered... but still...

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:59.500
What?! You mean, in front of everyone...

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:02.650
I said "Komatsu has a crush on you,"
and stuff like that?!

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:06.610
After that, Komatsu was saying "I'll kill myself! I'll kill myself!"

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:08.090
You caused total chaos, y'know!

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:11.420
Even when hypnotized,
you cause everyone trouble, eh?

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:12.730
Uh-huh.

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:17.220
Even if it's an action
taken under hypnosis...

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:20.200
...when I think that it's
something that I did...

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:22.980
OH MY...

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:23.350
Howdy!

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:26.320
Good morning!
Howdy!

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:28.220
Howdy!
Good morning!

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:42.990
Wh... What's with this?! What's going on here?!

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:45.680
Nono! Nono means NO!

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:49.680
Today, tomorrow and the day after that...
He does lunch with ME!

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:51.180
What?!

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:51.370
Gee!
What?!

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:51.460
What?!

00:22:51.460 --> 00:22:55.400
Hey, what do you think you're doing?!

00:22:55.400 --> 00:22:57.940
Can it, why don't you!

00:22:57.940 --> 00:22:58.520
Hikaru!

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:02.080
Yo, Kasuga-KUN!
Hikaru!

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:02.170
Hikaru!

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:05.040
Komatsu! Hi there!

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:07.150
Kasuga...

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:11.510
Thanks for EVERYTHING!

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:14.540
I had a real good time!

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.530
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:44.780
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:49.110
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:53.350
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.350 --> 00:24:01.230
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:10.730
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:18.540
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:27.220
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:36.930
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.930 --> 00:24:45.310
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.310 --> 00:24:49.640
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:53.980
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.980 --> 00:24:58.280
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.280 --> 00:25:02.620
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:07.440
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:16.340
Because I wanted to find out what Ayukawa's true feelings are...

00:25:16.340 --> 00:25:18.570
...I switched places with Kazuya!

00:25:18.570 --> 00:25:21.840
But I can't use his telepathy at all...

00:25:21.840 --> 00:25:26.350
...and Kazuya goes out to enjoy
some "grown-up fun" with Hikaru.

00:25:26.350 --> 00:25:30.650
Next time: "Kyosuke's Become a Kid! Getting Super Close to Madoka."

00:25:30.650 --> 00:25:33.670
I... was such a fool!
